#: main.py:1351
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You have {n} pads remaining in this scrap session.\n"
"\n"
"Use large-batch optimization for this session?\n"
"\n"
"The nester will try several pad orderings per scrap and keep the best "
"result. Typically fits 5-15% more pads per scrap on large batches, but "
"adds ~5-30 seconds of compute per scrap.\n"
"\n"
"Applies to every remaining scrap in this session."
msgstr ""
"Es sind noch {n} Polster in dieser Verschnitt-Sitzung.\n"
